{"sections":[{"slug":"万有丛","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"万有丛"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">万有丛</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“万有丛”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Milnor: Construction of Universal Bundles</p>\n<p>$n$-<span lang=\"zh\">万有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是指全空间</span> $(n-1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">连通的主丛</span>.</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\begin{array}{rcccl} P&amp;\\to&amp;P\\times EG&amp;\\to&amp;EG\\\\ \\downarrow&amp;&amp;\\downarrow&amp;&amp;\\downarrow\\pi\\\\ M&amp;\\to s&amp; P\\times_G EG &amp;\\to &amp; BG \\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>Milnor <span lang=\"zh\">的构造</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">任意</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">足够好的</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">连通空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上存在</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">万有丛</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">选定基点</span> $x_0\\in X$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $PX$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上所有始于</span> $x_0$ <span lang=\"zh\">的道路的空间</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">道路的终点给出映射</span> $p\\colon PX\\to X$. <span lang=\"zh\">定义环路空间</span> $\\Omega X=p^{-1}(x_0)$. <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $PX$ <span lang=\"zh\">是可缩的</span> $\\Omega X$-<span lang=\"zh\">丛</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong> (Milnor). $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上任何</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛都诱导自拓扑群同态</span> $\\Omega X \\to G$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}